WEBVTT

00:03.800 --> 00:05.200
General

00:13.560 --> 00:14.360
Marquis of Nan

00:14.440 --> 00:15.680
How have you been lately?

00:15.760 --> 00:16.840
Doing well, General

00:16.920 --> 00:18.320
Inside

00:23.520 --> 00:24.360
Get up, get up

00:24.440 --> 00:26.720
Quickly get up and pay respects to General Shilang

00:26.800 --> 00:27.760
General

00:27.840 --> 00:29.120
I told you these Xuan people

00:29.200 --> 00:30.600
Are all spineless

00:33.360 --> 00:34.360
I heard Xuan people

00:34.440 --> 00:35.640
Are refined

00:35.720 --> 00:37.720
And laugh at us as barbarians

00:38.960 --> 00:40.320
Marquis of Nan

00:40.400 --> 00:42.067
Could you perform a dance

00:42.400 --> 00:43.800
For me to see?

00:49.360 --> 00:50.760
Marquis of Nan

00:51.400 --> 00:53.400
Performs a dance for the general

01:22.680 --> 01:24.080
Good

01:24.360 --> 01:25.760
Good

01:27.880 --> 01:29.280
Good

01:32.640 --> 01:34.040
Good

01:35.880 --> 01:38.280
Give him food tonight

01:46.640 --> 01:48.040
Good

01:49.500 --> 02:01.000
In the eighteen years that followed, the aging Prince of Jin, Sikong Yao, endured great hardships to bide his time. At last, he found an opportunity while serving wine to assassinate Wu Jun's Grand Chanyu Ayiji, succeeding in a single strike.

